What are you planning to do?

252
00:18:17,920 --> 00:18:21,620
Next I'll activate my
Soul Charge Magic Card,

253
00:18:21,820 --> 00:18:25,960
allowing me to summon even more
monsters from my graveyard.

254
00:18:26,740 --> 00:18:29,420
Whoa, that's four monsters! Look,

255
00:18:29,800 --> 00:18:34,017
any monster that's summoned by using
Soul Charge can't attack for one turn,

256
00:18:34,100 --> 00:18:34,930
so he's safe.

257
00:18:35,180 --> 00:18:36,540
Then why do it?

258
00:18:36,660 --> 00:18:37,601
What's his plan?

259
00:18:37,920 --> 00:18:38,861
Well, that's it.

260
00:18:39,020 --> 00:18:41,240
My graveyard is completely empty.

261
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:43,300
My guardians are free.

262
00:18:44,380 --> 00:18:45,900
That's true. Now what?

263
00:18:46,500 --> 00:18:48,480
I think you know, Pharaoh.

264
00:18:48,840 --> 00:18:52,980
Each monster I brought back from
the grave cost me 500 points.

265
00:18:54,220 --> 00:18:55,340
Game over.

266
00:18:56,980 --> 00:18:57,810
Raphael!

267
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:10,140
It's Iartos.

268
00:19:13,740 --> 00:19:16,100
You've made the correct choice, Rafael.

269
00:19:16,500 --> 00:19:18,320
The darkness has lifted.

270
00:19:21,500 --> 00:19:23,780
You're right. Thank you.

271
00:19:24,620 --> 00:19:25,450
Rafael!

272
00:19:25,940 --> 00:19:26,957
We missed you.

273
00:19:27,040 --> 00:19:29,040
We'll see you soon.

274
00:19:29,300 --> 00:19:30,680
Yeah, real soon.

275
00:19:31,540 --> 00:19:32,940
I get it now.

276
00:19:33,500 --> 00:19:36,029
This is a vision of
what's inside my heart.

277
00:19:36,580 --> 00:19:39,060
Everyone I turn my back on is still here.

278
00:19:39,400 --> 00:19:41,520
And they'll always be with me.

279
00:19:58,660 --> 00:19:59,490
Raphael!

280
00:20:00,580 --> 00:20:02,340
Hey, the seal is gone!

281
00:20:02,720 --> 00:20:03,660
Where'd it go?

282
00:20:04,240 --> 00:20:07,117
Doesn't it usually put on
a big green laser show?

283
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:10,380
Yeah, and it usually
takes someone's soul, too.

284
00:20:10,800 --> 00:20:12,960
Wait, so you're still here?

285
00:20:13,360 --> 00:20:15,340
I'm lost. I have a theory.

286
00:20:15,840 --> 00:20:20,680
The seal of Ori Kalkos is powered by the
darkness within the person who plays it.

287
00:20:21,180 --> 00:20:24,100
But Raphael was able to
conquer that darkness.

288
00:20:24,460 --> 00:20:26,437
So my soul was spared.

289
00:20:26,520 --> 00:20:27,440
I'm free.

290
00:20:30,700 --> 00:20:31,920
What's going on?

291
00:20:33,040 --> 00:20:34,060
Oh, no.

292
00:20:34,900 --> 00:20:36,780
Oh, yes. What?

293
00:20:36,980 --> 00:20:38,156
Is it an earthquake?

294
00:20:38,420 --> 00:20:40,700
I'm afraid it's much worse than that.
